<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>회원가입</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        body { display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; height: 100vh; }
        .auth-box { width: 400px; padding: 2rem; background: white; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="auth-box">
        <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--primary-color);">회원가입</h2>
        
        <form action="/auth/register" method="POST">
            <div style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                <label style="font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: bold; color: #4b5563;">아이디</label>
                <input type="text" name="username" placeholder="사용할 아이디를 입력하세요" required style="margin-top: 5px;">
            </div>

            <div style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                <label style="font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: bold; color: #4b5563;">비밀번호</label>
                <input type="password" name="password" placeholder="비밀번호를 입력하세요" required style="margin-top: 5px;">
            </div>

            <div style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                <label style="font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: bold; color: #4b5563;">닉네임</label>
                <input type="text" name="nickname" placeholder="게시판에서 활동할 이름" required style="margin-top: 5px;">
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; margin-top: 10px;">가입하기</button>
        </form>

        <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 1rem; color: #666;">
            이미 계정이 있으신가요? <a href="/auth/login" style="color: var(--primary-color); font-weight: bold;">로그인</a>
        </p>
        <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 0.5rem;">
            <a href="/" style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #999;">홈으로 돌아가기</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>